":61.12},{"w":"is","s":61.54,"e":61.84},{"w":"the","s":61.84,"e":62.16},{"w":"Pareto","s":62.16,"e":62.56},{"w":"front.","s":62.56,"e":62.78}]},{"id":"s05","start":63.68,"end":79.09,"sentences":[{"text":"A plan is on the Pareto front when no other plan is at least as good on every goal and better on one.","start":64.03,"end":71.62},{"text":"Picking from the front isn’t maths any more.","start":72.07,"end":74.68},{"text":"It’s a judgement about what matters more.","start":75.13,"end":78.39}],"words":[{"w":"A","s":64.03,"e":64.17},{"w":"plan","s":64.17,"e":64.51},{"w":"is","s":64.51,"e":64.97},{"w":"on","s":64.97,"e":65.13},{"w":"the","s":65.13,"e":65.25},{"w":"Pareto","s":65.25,"e":65.77},{"w":"front","s":65.77,"e":66.07},{"w":"when","s":66.07,"e":66.65},{"w":"no","s":66.65,"e":66.97},{"w":"other","s":66.97,"e":67.29},{"w":"plan","s":67.29,"e":67.63},{"w":"is","s":67.63,"e":67.97},{"w":"at","s":67.97,"e":68.11},{"w":"least","s":68.11,"e":68.43},{"w":"as","s":68.43,"e":68.67},{"w":"good","s":68.67,"e":68.91},{"w":"on","s":68.91,"e":69.19},{"w":"every","s":69.19,"e":69.65},{"w":"goal","s":69.65,"e":70.05},{"w":"and","s":70.05,"e":70.63},{"w":"better","s":70.63,"e":70.93},{"w":"on","s":70.93,"e":71.23},{"w":"one.","s":71.23,"e":71.45},{"w":"Picking","s":72.07,"e":72.41},{"w":"from","s":72.41,"e":72.63},{"w":"the","s":72.63,"e":72.81},{"w":"front","s":72.81,"e":73.11},{"w":"isn’t","s":73.11,"e":73.69},{"w":"maths","s":73.69,"e":73.97},{"w":"any","s":73.97,"e":74.27},{"w":"more.","s":74.27,"e":74.53},{"w":"It’s","s":75.13,"e":75.67},{"w":"a","s":75.67,"e":75.67},{"w":"judgement","s":75.67,"e":76.11},{"w":"about","s":76.11,"e":76.73},{"w":"what","s":76.73,"e":77.27},{"w":"matters","s":77.27,"e":77.71},{"w":"more.","s":77.71,"e":78.11}]},{"id":"s06","start":79.09,"end":98.06,"sentences":[{"text":"One way to choose is to give each goal a weight.","start":79.44,"end":82.93},{"text":"Count one exam day as much as one clashing pupil, and plan D wins: six plus one is seven.","st